              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சமரசம் (camaracam) is borrowed from Sanskrit samarasa, \"having equal feelings\" (Monier-Williams), from sama, \"equal\", and rasa, \"taste, feeling\": a state where both sides feel alike."
